# AI agent ignore list: keep agent session noise and generated/build
# artifacts out of the agent's context and file search. Git-wise these
# are already covered by .gitignore; this file is only about agent
# tooling (aider reads it as .aiderignore).
.aider*
.claude/
.codex
.zed/
build/
.dart_tool/
**/flutter/ephemeral/
AppDir
appimage-build
.flatpak-builder
.tools/
packaging/linux/flatpak/built-*/
test/failures/
auxiliary/**/*.pdf
**/therion*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
